course: dictionary
lesson: 7789
title: Quadrillion: a very, very big number
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A quadrillion is a number so big that it is hard to picture. The best way in is to count the zeros. A million has 6 zeros, a billion has 9, a trillion has 12, and a quadrillion has 15.
explain: «A 2022 study estimated about 20 quadrillion ants on Earth.» The writer chose quadrillion because a number with 16 zeros is too big to say any other way. Check it: 20 quadrillion is a 2 with 16 zeros after it.
explain: Each step up adds three zeros. So you can work out a new big number from the one before it. Read the number, count the zeros, then say the name.
fact: A quadrillion is 1,000,000,000,000,000, which is a thousand trillion.
fact: Each big-number name adds three zeros: million has 6, billion has 9, trillion has 12, and quadrillion has 15.
fact: «About 20 quadrillion ants» means a 2 with 16 zeros after it.
fact: In everyday talk, quadrillion can just mean a huge number, as in «a quadrillion dollars».
fact: Scientists use very big numbers to count things that are too many to count one by one, like ants on Earth.
exercise: How many zeros does a quadrillion have? | *15 | 12 | 16 | 6
exercise: Which number is one quadrillion? | 1,000,000 | 1,000,000,000 | 1,000,000,000,000 | *1,000,000,000,000,000
exercise: Which number has 12 zeros? | billion | million | quadrillion | *trillion
test: The study said «about 20 quadrillion ants». 20 quadrillion is a 2 followed by how many zeros? | 12 | *16 | 15 | 20
test: Which name goes with a 1 followed by 9 zeros? | *billion | trillion | quadrillion | million
exam: A quadrillion is a 1 followed by how many zeros? | 9 | 12 | 6 | *15
